    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">There is something unique about perfectly filling those slots with blocks!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cozy, pressure-free block puzzle awaits under the sea!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/extras/b0f487e73ac4cee0d2f9237ec21a6443.poster.avif?t=1740081911\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/extras/b0f487e73ac4cee0d2f9237ec21a6443.webm?t=1740081911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/extras/b0f487e73ac4cee0d2f9237ec21a6443.mp4?t=1740081911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Sit back, relax and enjoy Cozy Blocks, a stress-free under the sea puzzle adventure! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose the right pieces, place them into the tower and solve the puzzle in this unique yet familiar mechanic. Help Kate Nemo and the cute sea creatures to complete tricky missions in the 3 beautiful worlds of this captivating underwater adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/extras/b4c1c9a888e666ea365f668d0ca90b97.avif?t=1740081911\" /></div></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Take Your Time:</strong>\u00a0No pressure, no timers. Look into the blocks and choose your strategy at your own pace.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Flip, Turn, fit:</strong>\u00a0Manipulate the pieces without any constraints. That L-shaped piece is so much better in Cozy Blocks!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Collect cute buddies:</strong>\u00a0As you progress in your adventure, unlock new cute animals that grant special powers to help you beat the puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story mode:</strong>\u00a0Take your time in this relaxed and casual main mode. Help Kate Nemo in her journey to find her grandfather!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Party Game Mode:</strong> Versus fun! 2 to 4 players in a score attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival Mode:</strong>\u00a0Complete the lines in the tower to get more oxygen and keep playing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy, Accessible, Fun Gameplay:</strong> great for all ages, from grandkids to grandparents!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/extras/4e0964e40df198bca023759a509ed616.avif?t=1740081911\" /></div></p>",
