ss in your adventure, unlock new cute animals that grant special powers to help you beat the puzzles!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Story mode:</strong>\u00a0Take your time in this relaxed and casual main mode. Help Kate Nemo in her journey to find her grandfather!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Party Game Mode:</strong> Versus fun! 2 to 4 players in a score attack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Survival Mode:</strong>\u00a0Complete the lines in the tower to get more oxygen and keep playing!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Cozy, Accessible, Fun Gameplay:</strong> great for all ages, from grandkids to grandparents!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1522300/extras/4e0964e40df198bca023759a509ed616.avif?t=1740081911\" /></div></p>",
